obligations.text:
Before: &lang;Raid&rang; &lang;Partition (purple Lv.4 & red Lv.4)&rang;
[When Digivolving] If DNA digivolving, you may play 1 level 5 or lower Digimon card with the [Free] trait from your trash without paying the cost.Then, 1 of your Digimon gains &lang;Rush&rang; for the turn and may attack a player.
After: &lang;Raid&rang; &lang;Partition (purple Lv.4 & red Lv.4)&rang;
[When Digivolving] If DNA digivolving, you may play 1 level 5 or lower Digimon card with the [Free] trait from your trash without paying the cost. Then, 1 of your Digimon may gain &lang;Rush&rang; for the turn and attack a player.
Notes: Read as the errata when playing.
